  "description": "The emotion expressed is derision, conveyed through the juxtaposition of the grotesque Frankenstein's monster wax figure with the text 'feel that? it used to belong to bruce jenner!'. The meme uses horror imagery to mock and demean Bruce Jenner's identity and transition, implying he is unnatural or monstrous. This creates a hostile and mocking emotional tone directed at the individual.",
